{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a chaotic, action-packed adventure in <i>Dungeon Rampage</i>, the ultimate revival of the cult-classic online multiplayer dungeon crawler! Team up with friends or face the hordes solo as you dive deep into monster-filled dungeons, unlock powerful heroes, and smash your way through epic, fast-paced battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/Fight_Tonight!.gif?t=1749480218\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/DungeonRampage_Features.png?t=1749480218\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-Op Dungeon Crawling</strong>: Team up with up to 4 players in online co-op or battle your way solo through thrilling, premade or procedural dungeons packed with enemies, traps, and treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1749480218\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Heroes</strong>: Choose from a variety of unique heroes, each with their own skills, weapons, and playstyles. Who will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/Hereos.png?t=1749480218\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable Gear and Abilities</strong>: Level up your heroes and unlock powerful weapons with unique abilities to suit your playstyle. Hundreds of items and skill upgrades to ensure endless strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/Train.png?t=1749480218\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: With procedurally generated dungeons, no two runs are the same. Face new challenges every time you play, from massive boss battles to cleverly hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/Map.jpg?t=1749480218\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3053950?t=1749480218","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3053950?t=1749480218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/c08c8710daa9fb288739509050f112a9704162b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749480218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/c08c8710daa9fb288739509050f112a9704162b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749480218","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a chaotic, action-packed adventure in <i>Dungeon Rampage</i>, the ultimate revival of the cult-classic online multiplayer dungeon crawler! Team up with friends or face the hordes solo as you dive deep into monster-filled dungeons, unlock powerful heroes, and smash your way through epic, fast-paced battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/Fight_Tonight!.gif?t=1749480218\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.ak